# Build output. The debug profile reaches tens of gigabytes on this crate
# because every feature combination is compiled separately.
/target

# Reference material, not part of this library.
#
# `gpui-kit` is the upstream project whose visual language this crate ports. It
# is a checkout kept beside the sources for consultation, with its own history,
# and it is not ours to redistribute — the files that were actually derived from
# it are called out in NOTICE. Nothing in the build refers to it.
/gpui-kit

# Editor and OS noise.
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
.zcode/

# Scratch files from profiling or manual rendering checks.
*.profraw
perf.data*
